{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>Not a man is El, that He should lie.</b> He is not a man to retract from his blessing, since I blessed them today in His name — for they have not transgressed." "<b>And not a son of man, that He should relent.</b> There are three kinds of relenting: one in someone who does not stand by his word, and another in someone who is unable, and the third in the recipient's transgression. Regarding the first two, Balaam said: 'and a son of man, that He should relent.'"], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:19:26.884767284Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}